{%- comment -%}
  Shared Purelane assets. Every Purelane section renders this first so it works
  standalone — a merchant can add the reviews rail to a page with no hero and it
  still has its tokens, its fonts and its reveal behaviour.

  Duplicate <link> tags for the same href are deduplicated by the browser at the
  network layer and are idempotent at the CSS layer. The reveal script guards
  against double execution internally.

  Fonts are self-hosted rather than pulled from Google.

  The design specifies Outfit for display and Inter for body, neither of which is
  in Shopify's font picker. The prototype loaded both from fonts.googleapis.com,
  which costs a DNS lookup, a TCP connection and a TLS handshake to a third party
  before a single glyph can be requested — all on the critical path for the
  hero headline, which is the LCP element on most viewports. Shopify's own
  `theme check` flags it as RemoteAsset for exactly this reason.

  Both families ship as variable fonts, so one 32-48KB latin-subset file covers
  every weight the design uses. They are served from Shopify's CDN, preloaded so
  the fetch starts with the HTML rather than after CSS parses, and declared with
  font-display: swap so text paints in the fallback immediately either way.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign outfit = 'purelane-outfit.woff2' | asset_url
  assign inter = 'purelane-inter.woff2' | asset_url
-%}

{{ outfit | preload_tag: as: 'font', type: 'font/woff2', crossorigin: 'anonymous' }}
{{ inter | preload_tag: as: 'font', type: 'font/woff2', crossorigin: 'anonymous' }}

<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Outfit';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 500 800;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url({{ outfit }}) format('woff2');
    unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+2000-206F, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Inter';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400 700;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url({{ inter }}) format('woff2');
    unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+2000-206F, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;
  }
</style>

{{ 'purelane-core.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'purelane-reveal.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
